This is the validation of AutoDock analysis results, which performs molecular docking analysis between the 3D drug molecular structure and the protein.
In addition, we obtained immunohistochemistry results of the target protein in tumor tissues from male patients from the Human Protein Atlas database ([https://www.proteinatlas.org/](https://www.proteinatlas.org/)) to evaluate the potential value of candidate drugs.
These results show that the binding energy between the drug molecule and the protein is less than −6, and the target protein is highly expressed in the tumor region, indicating that the drugs identified via Drug2Cell possess potential value.
